# without EscapeAnalysis nothing is noted of what was made here. Link has followed the list, which nobody but the loop gets hold of: it is not asked whether it is as made either
# PROGRAM-OF: loop-over-a-list-that-a-built-in-has-just-made-has-no-arm-of-the-protocol.ir
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all-EscapeAnalysis
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = GetArrayLength
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=all-EscapeAnalysis
# NEVER-NOT: IsPristine
# code that nobody has seen has had the list in hand, so the list is asked
# RUN(LOOKED): walk f2 mechanisms=all-EscapeAnalysis
# LOOKED-LABEL: code f2:Body
# LOOKED: = IsPristine {{*}}builtinClass=Array
